1. Description

    Implemented the core subscription management actions for the Pharma Store, allowing customers to control their active medicine subscriptions directly from the Subscription Dashboard.

    The implementation provides customers with the ability to pause, resume, skip the next delivery, and cancel subscriptions without needing to contact the pharmacy manually.

    These actions were integrated with the existing subscription dashboard and automated refill workflow so that changes made by customers are reflected in future refill and delivery processing.

2. Business Requirement

    Customers need flexibility when managing recurring medicine deliveries. A fixed recurring schedule may not always be suitable because customers may:

    Have enough medicine for the next cycle.
    Temporarily stop taking a medicine.
    Go on vacation.
    Need to postpone a delivery.
    No longer require a medicine.
    Want to restart a previously paused subscription.

    The system therefore required self-service subscription controls.

3. Subscription Actions Implemented

    The following actions were implemented:

    View Details
    Pause Subscription
    Resume Subscription
    Skip Next Delivery
    Cancel Subscription

    Each action performs a specific operation on the customer's subscription.

