    Implemented a View Details action that allows customers to open the complete information for an individual subscription.

    The details page displays:

    Medicine name.
    Product image.
    Quantity.
    Subscription frequency.
    Subscription price.
    Current status.
    Next delivery date.
    Last refill date.
    Subscription start date.
    Refill information.

