    [ Cancel ]


5. Pause Subscription

    Implemented the ability to temporarily pause an active subscription.

    Workflow
    Active
      ↓
    Pause Subscription
      ↓
    Paused

    When a subscription is paused:

    Future automated refills are temporarily stopped.
    The subscription remains stored.
    Existing subscription information is retained.
    The customer can resume the subscription later.


6. Pause Confirmation

    Added confirmation before pausing a subscription to prevent accidental actions.

    Example:

    Pause Subscription?


    Your upcoming medicine deliveries will be
    temporarily stopped.


    [ Keep Active ]    [ Pause Subscription ]

    After successful confirmation:

    ✓ Subscription paused successfully.


7. Resume Subscription

    Implemented the ability to restart a paused subscription.

    Workflow
    Paused
      ↓
    Resume Subscription
      ↓
    Active

   When resumed:

    Subscription status changes to Active.
    Refill scheduling resumes.
    The next delivery date is recalculated where applicable.
    Automated refill processing becomes active again.

    Example:

     Subscription Status


     Paused


     [ Resume Subscription ]

     After the action:

     ✓ Subscription resumed successfully.


8. Skip Next Delivery

    Implemented a Skip Next Delivery action that allows customers to skip only the next scheduled medicine refill without cancelling the subscription.

    Workflow
    Active Subscription
          ↓
    Skip Next Delivery
          ↓
    Current Delivery Skipped
          ↓
    Subscription Remains Active
          ↓
    Next Delivery Scheduled

    Example:

      Current Next Delivery:
      15 September 2026


      Skip Next Delivery


          ↓


      Next Delivery:
      15 October 2026

      This is useful when a customer already has enough medicine for the upcoming cycle.

9. Skip Confirmation

    Added confirmation before skipping a delivery.

    Example:

    Skip Next Delivery?


    Your upcoming delivery will be skipped,
    but your subscription will remain active.


    [ Go Back ]    [ Skip Delivery ]

    Confirmation message:

    ✓ Next delivery skipped successfully.


10. Cancel Subscription

     Implemented subscription cancellation functionality.

     Workflow
     Active
       ↓
     Cancel Subscription
       ↓
     Confirmation
       ↓
     Cancelled

     After cancellation:

     Future recurring refills are stopped.
     Future automated orders are prevented.
     Subscription status changes to Cancelled.
     Historical subscription information remains available.


11. Cancellation Confirmation

    Added a confirmation dialog to prevent accidental cancellation.

    Example:

     Cancel Subscription?


     Future medicine deliveries will be stopped.
     You can create a new subscription later.


     [ Keep Subscription ]    [ Cancel Subscription ]

     After confirmation:

     ✓ Subscription cancelled successfully.


12. Subscription State Management

     Integrated the actions with subscription states.

                 ┌───────────┐
                 │  Active   │
                 └─────┬─────┘
                       │
          ┌────────────┼─────────────┐
          ↓            ↓             ↓
       Pause         Skip          Cancel
          ↓            │             ↓
       Paused          │        Cancelled
          │            │
        Resume         │
          ↓            │
        Active ←───────┘

    This provides a controlled subscription lifecycle.

13. Automated Refill Integration

     Subscription actions were integrated with the previously implemented automated refill workflow.

     Paused Subscription
     Status = Paused
            ↓
     Skip Automated Refill
     Cancelled Subscription
     Status = Cancelled
            ↓
     Stop Future Refills
     Skipped Delivery
     Skip Next = True
            ↓
     Skip Current Refill
            ↓
     Schedule Next Cycle
     Active Subscription
     Status = Active
            ↓
    Continue Automated Refill

    This prevents unwanted medicine orders from being generated after customers change their subscription settings.

