19. Action Workflow

     The general action-processing flow is:

     Customer selects action
            ↓
     Validate subscription
            ↓
     Check current status
            ↓
     Confirm action if required
            ↓
     Update subscription
            ↓
     Update refill schedule
            ↓
     Update dashboard
            ↓
     Display confirmation

    This ensures subscription changes are processed consistently.

20. Validation

     Validation was implemented to ensure that actions are performed only when appropriate.

     Examples:

      Pause

      Only an active subscription can be paused.

      Resume

      Only a paused subscription can be resumed.

      Skip

      Only an active subscription with a future delivery can skip the next delivery.

      Cancel

      An already cancelled subscription cannot be cancelled again.

      This reduces inconsistent subscription states.

